Package: spot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Recommends: postgresql-18
Description: Spotledger site host
 Spotledger is a single-binary site host on PostgreSQL. This package installs
 the daemon, a hardened systemd unit with its sysusers and tmpfiles data, and
 a safe default configuration under /etc/spot.
 .
 The service is installed but deliberately not started or enabled: an
 administrator provisions a site first and then starts it.
